; 4_voice_get_ready — SSG voice cue: "GET READY!"
;
; Pure SSG can't synthesise real speech, but we can approximate the
; cadence + pitch contour of an arcade voice cue.  Three syllable
; bursts at descending pitches with sharp attacks:
;
;   GET   = G5  short
;   REA-  = E5  short
;   -DY   = D5  short
;   !     = A5  longer (exclamation)
;
; T220 L32 (~123 ms per note) keeps the cadence syllable-fast.

T220
P0
V12
O5
L32

G G G  R32
E E E  R32
D D D  R32
A8

~
